meta {
  name: brand-kits
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Staff-only CRUD for `brand_kits` (T1, `odd/tasks/theme-authoring.md`).
  A brand kit's `key` is immutable after creation — it is not accepted on
  `PATCH`. `overrides` follows the same `ThemeOverrides` shape as
  `events.theme_overrides` and `event_themes` presets, validated with the
  same URL/contrast/placeholder rules.

  On `PATCH`, sending `overrides` REPLACES the stored value entirely — it
  is not deep-merged with the existing overrides.

  The Brillipoint kit (`key = 'brillipoint'`) is seeded and delete-protected
  (`DELETE` on it returns 409).
}
